<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Monday's English premier league match:</p>
<p>Wimbledon 3 (Gayle 12th, Ekoku 38th, 73rd,) Southampton 1 (Oakley 77). Halftime 2-0. Attendance 8,572.</p>
